,"created_at":"2014-06-13T21:19:18Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T08:47:27Z","pushed_at":"2024-08-07T18:54:48Z","git_url":"git://github.com/google/ExoPlayer.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:google/ExoPlayer.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer","homepage":"https://developer.android.com/media/media3/exoplayer","size":484242,"stargazers_count":21911,"watchers_count":21911,"language":"Java","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":6031,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":634,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":6031,"open_issues":634,"watchers":21911,"default_branch":"release-v2","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"### [REQUIRED] Issue description\r\nAfter the commit\r\nhttps://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/commit/535e14cb4d69ca41f91118cf2bd201ea94746d53\r\n\r\nSome TV devices start to have a issue, those TV devices are connected to soundbar devices and have the issue, if the soundbar is disconnected no issue.\r\n\r\nThe player doesn't play only shows a frame as if it was paused no sound.\r\n\r\nSee more here:\r\nhttps://github.com/fgl27/SmartTwitchTV/issues/10 \r\n\r\n### [REQUIRED] Reproduction steps\r\nPlay a video AVC/MP4 on that particularly TV/Soundbar config\r\n\r\n### [REQUIRED] Link to test content\r\nAny AVC/MP4 video causes it\r\n\r\n### [REQUIRED] A full bug report captured from the device\r\n\r\n[bugreport-BRAVIA_ATV2_EU-OPR2.170623.027.S30-2020-05-12-08-24-13.zip](https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/files/4660997/bugreport-BRAVIA_ATV2_EU-OPR2.170623.027.S30-2020-05-12-08-24-13.zip)\r\n\r\nI have added this commit:\r\nhttps://github.com/fgl27/ExoPlayer/commit/a18257d2b55ac18a9b33ab36436913d933b00cec\r\nThat included some logs with the tag **AAC_CHECK** plus the app running has the tag **STTV_PlayerActivity**\r\n\r\nOn bellow logcat the resume from the bug report, of the starting the app until the bug report start be generated\r\n\r\n[logcat_AAC_CHECK.txt](https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/files/4661003/logcat_AAC_CHECK.txt)\r\n\r\nIs possible to see that the player goes to all steps `prepare(), Player.STATE_BUFFERING, Player.STATE_READY`, but the player doesn't play for the user, only a frame is display as if it was paused no sound.\r\n\r\n### [REQUIRED] Version of ExoPlayer being used\r\ndev-v2 branch\r\n\r\n### [REQUIRED] Device(s) and version(s) of Android being used\r\n\r\nTV Sony ZD9 4K \r\nOS Android 8.0\r\nSoundbar Sony ZF9","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7407/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7407/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":3360523748,"node_id":"MDE0OlVubGFiZWxlZEV2ZW50MzM2MDUyMzc0OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/events/3360523748","actor":{"login":"andrewlewis","id":107897,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNzg5Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107897?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis","html_url":"https://github.com/andrewlewis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andrewlewis/s